# Health Claims Demo
#
# Flask front-end (login + claim UI) + gRPC InsuranceService backend.
#
# Quick start:
#   cd health
#   make up
#
# Open http://127.0.0.1:5000
#   juanjo / juanjo01
#   tom / tom01
#
# Architecture:
#   Browser → Flask (frontend:5000) → gRPC InsuranceService (backend:50051)
#
# gRPC RPCs:
#   CheckEligibility → RequestAuthorization → SubmitClaim
#
# Makefile:
#   make up          start stack
#   make down        stop stack
#   make proto       compile proto stubs
#   make logs        follow logs
